WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.812
Riley: Our pets are having fun.

2
00:00:06.813 --> 00:00:09.710
Chatter: Woo, woo!

3
00:00:09.711 --> 00:00:12.083
Kelli: What are you doing?

4
00:00:12.084 --> 00:00:17.355
Theo: We're giving our pets a ride.

5
00:00:17.356 --> 00:00:21.033
Skyler: Chatter loves the train.

6
00:00:21.034 --> 00:00:23.920
Theo: So does Frankie.

7
00:00:23.921 --> 00:00:27.222
Ben: I hope it's not too fast for Speedy.

8
00:00:27.223 --> 00:00:32.641
Theo: Uh-oh. Whiskers rolled off!

9
00:00:32.642 --> 00:00:33.909
Kelli: Mom went shopping.

10
00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:36.015
I'm babysitting you.

11
00:00:36.016 --> 00:00:38.409
Theo: We're not babies!

12
00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:43.457
Kelli: Whatever. I'm going outside to weed the

13
00:00:43.458 --> 00:00:45.719
garden. Will you be okay in here?

14
00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:47.544
Theo: Yes!

15
00:00:47.545 --> 00:00:49.660
Kelli: Don't get into any trouble!

16
00:00:49.661 --> 00:00:51.397
Riley: We won't.

17
00:00:51.398 --> 00:00:56.425
Kelli: I'll be outside if you need anything.

18
00:00:56.426 --> 00:00:59.768
Ben: Let's pretend the train is going west.

19
00:00:59.769 --> 00:01:08.573
Riley: Next stop, Grand Canyon!

20
00:01:08.574 --> 00:01:13.309
Theo: Everyone, out!

21
00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:18.544
Ben: Speedy looks dizzy.

22
00:01:18.545 --> 00:01:21.310
Riley: Do turtles get dizzy?

23
00:01:21.311 --> 00:01:24.086
Sarah: Maybe the train was too fast.

24
00:01:24.087 --> 00:01:28.185
Skyler: Whiskers couldn't even hold on.

25
00:01:28.186 --> 00:01:34.483
Theo: Hey, where is Whiskers?

26
00:01:34.484 --> 00:01:36.579
Ben: I saw him a minute ago.

27
00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:38.092
Now he's gone.

28
00:01:38.093 --> 00:01:40.803
Skyler: Whiskers, where are you?

29
00:01:40.804 --> 00:01:43.946
Riley: I'll look behind the desk.

30
00:01:43.947 --> 00:01:48.819
Theo: I'll look under my bed.

31
00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:52.396
Sarah: It's dark under here.

32
00:01:52.397 --> 00:01:54.974
Skyler: We need a flashlight.

33
00:01:54.975 --> 00:02:03.507
Theo: Let's go ask my sister for

34
00:02:03.508 --> 00:02:07.942
one. Kelli! Do you have a flashlight?

35
00:02:07.943 --> 00:02:10.109
Kelli: There's one in the kitchen.

36
00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:12.147
What do you need it for?

37
00:02:12.148 --> 00:02:15.378
Sarah: We have to find Whiskers.

38
00:02:15.379 --> 00:02:22.378
Ben: Look! Whiskers is hanging from the roof!

39
00:02:22.379 --> 00:02:27.411
Kelli: Run upstairs and grab him, quick!

40
00:02:27.412 --> 00:02:33.515
Theo: I can't. The front door is locked!

41
00:02:33.516 --> 00:02:41.552
Kelli: And I don't have a key with me!

